    "basic_qualifications": "- 3+ years of data engineering experience<br/>- 1+ years of developing and operating large-scale data structures for business intelligence analytics using ETL/ELT processes experience<br/>- 1+ years of developing and operating large-scale data structures for business intelligence analytics using SQL experience<br/>- Bachelor's degree or foreign equivalent in Computer Science, Engineering, Information Systems, Mathematics, or a related field",
